ePiX Manual

March 05, 2006

ePiX comes packaged four ways:

1. epix-XXX_src.tar.bz2 (sources only). Since you're reading this
   file, you must have installed another version. :)

2. epix-XXX_complete.tar.bz2 (sources and uncompiled manuals). To
   build the documentation, do "make doc" from the source directory.

3. epix-XXX_withpdf.tar.bz2 (sources and compiled manuals). The manual
   is a PDF file in the source directory. You can build another copy
   by running "make doc" from there.

4. epix-XXX_manuals.tar.bz2 (compiled samples and manuals only).

The "make doc" target builds compressed PostScript and PDF files, as
well as a compressed tar file of the LaTeX and ePiX source files.
